# XCUSERDATA-2026-11-18: Xcode PER-USER IDE state, not project content. UserInterfaceState.xcuserstate
# is a 132 KB Apple binary plist that Xcode rewrites on nearly every interaction, so committing it adds
# a fresh binary blob per session to a repo already at 474 MB. DerivedData is build output and can be GB.
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
**/DerivedData/

# IOSRES-2026-11-18: the iPad bundle's copies of the 19 shared assets. GENERATED by
# gt_iosres_2026-11-18_v1.py from app/src/main/assets, which stays the one source of
# truth. Never edit these; re-run the script. StartupAssertion reads all 19 through the
# production bundle reader, so a stale or missing copy is named rather than silent.
iosapp/iosapp/Resources/
